/// Questions drawn from four more sets of the same classic school-quiz book.
///
/// Same approach as quiz_bank_quizbook.dart, and for the same reasons: the
/// source is in copyright and its rounds are open-ended or three-option, so
/// what is taken here is the subject matter and the answer -- facts, which
/// belong to nobody -- while the wording, the options and the distractors are
/// written fresh. Nothing is reproduced verbatim.
///
/// Filtered on the way in:
///
///   * settled facts only. The book is from 2016, so anything that has moved
///     on since is left out, as is anything resting on a figure that changes.
///
///   * one item in the source is dated wrongly -- it places a man's
///     appointment to the Ahmedabad Textile Labour Association in 1992, some
///     seventy years out -- so it is not used at all rather than repeated
///     with a corrected date I would be guessing at.
///
///   * questions the bank already asks are skipped, among them Alfred
///     Nobel's birthplace, the Caspian Sea, Hampi, Goa's liberation, who
///     discovered penicillin, iron in haemoglobin, the lens for short sight,
///     Sholay's composer, the Marble Rocks, and clove and the French word for
///     a nail.
